usage: reproduce.py [-h] {init,check,run,report} ...

Run from the repository root: python3 -m week4.lean_repair --help.

positional arguments:
  {init,check,run,report}
    init                pin an existing theorem and editable proof span
    check               local verification only
    run                 repair using billed OpenRouter calls
    report              aggregate per-problem API spend, including failed
                        calls

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
